                "loc": "ZEC.9.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Saka 9.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Olkilikuai oipirta Dameski. Ng'ura, meitoki Dameski aaku enkanasa, naa keaku ninye osototi loo suut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kepuoi aaing'uaa nkanas enyena o akenya; neaku ninche ndaat oo nkerrai, neirragie ninche ine nemeetae entoki naiture. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keiwuang'a ina ang nagol aitung'uaa Efraim, neiwuang'a enkitoo aitung'uaa Dameski; ore ilo pisiai oleku le Siria netiu anaa enkitoo oo nkera e Israel, Olaitoriani loo lororani ojo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore kenya te ina olong neitadouni enkitoo e Yakobo aaitabaiki enkop, ore ina piron o sesen lenye nesasu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ketiu ninye anaa te neisampisho olaisampuani, negilu ilng'osil le nkurma, netiu anaa ina kurma naitashe te nesuli ilng'osil lenyena netiu anaa oerata le Refaim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina natung'uayie olaisampuani ake naleku, anaa te neisampu olaisampuani ilng'anayio neing'uaa oare anaa okuni ootii shumata oleng, aashu oong'uan anaa imiet too lng'osil lo lchani loo lng'anayio, Olaitoriani Enkai e Israel ojo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore kenya te ina olong neaku keshilaa iltung'ana Ilo oitobira ninche, ore too nkonyek enye neing'or Ilo Sinyati le Israel; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "meitoki ninche aaisilig ilperereni loo lasarri, ina siai oo nkaik lenye, nemeitoki ninche aaing'or ina naitobira ilkimojik lenye, aa Asherim aashu ilperereni le nkorropil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore kenya te ina olong nena anas enye naagol, nepuo aatiu anaa nene wuejitin neeisikieki oo le Hafi o le Amori, nenen apa neeisikie ninche te nkaraki nkera oo Siraeli. Nepuo aaku ilmuaateni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enkaraki nikitorikine iyie Enkai e njeunoto ino, neitu iyie idamu ina dapidapoi e sarunoto ino; enkaraki ina pee ituno iyie nkaitubulu sidain, nipik iyie ntokitin oo nkaitin omon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore hoo nintubulu iyie ninche ina olong ake nituuno ninche, nincho ninche meitapuka pee ekenyu ake, ore ake eyia, kelo aimin enkisampuare, te ina olong o sina o ina mion nemeishiuni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etimiraki lelo oshon loo lmang'ati",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuaak, ening'o oltoilo loo ltung'ana kumok, eikurrukur ninche anaa enkikurrukur e naiposha! Kuak, enkikurrukur oo loreren kumok eikurrukur ninche anaa e nkikurrukur oo nkariak kumok! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keikurrukur iloshon anaa enkikurrukur oo nkariak kumok, kake kelo ninye aisikong ninche, neilanyisho ninche aaisik, nepuo ninche anaa suut too ldoinyio netiu anaa enterit nakutita olkutati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore teipa, ng'ura, nelotu olkirutoto! Ore eitu eaku tadekenya meekure eetae ninche! Ena ninye erubata e lelo ooibung iyiook aaraya, elaakinoto e lelo ooisim iyiook.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
